### ❌ Promises (Better, But Still Verbose)



```js id="pr1"
fetchData()
  .then(data => {
    return processData(data);
  })
  .then(result => {
    console.log(result);
  })
  .catch(err => {
    console.error(err);
  });

✔ Better than callbacks
